OL,4,G0030FThrough the Night
OL,5,     GGeorgian pianist Elisabeth
OL,6,     GLeonskaja performs Schubert's
OL,7,     GFour Impromptus D.899; joined by
OL,8,     GBudapest-born pianist Mihaly
OL,9,     GBerecz to play a selection of
OL,10,     GBrahms's Hungarian Dances.
OL,11,G0630FBreakfast
OL,12,     GTom McKinney presents Radio 3's
OL,13,     GBreakfast show. To get in touch,
OL,14,     Gemail 3breakfast@bbc.co.uk.
OL,15,G0930FEssential Classics
OL,16,     GGeorgia Mann plays the best in
OL,17,     Gclassical music, with discoveries
OL,18,     Gand surprises rubbing shoulders
OL,19,     Gwith familiar favourites.
